  Usage in RelayCore:
    RelayCore consumes LiteLLM as a Python pip dependency at runtime
    only. Specifically, RelayCore uses:
      - litellm.llms.*       (provider transformation modules)
      - litellm.main         (acompletion / completion entry points)
      - litellm.litellm_core_utils.streaming_handler
      - litellm.cost_calculator (optional)

    RelayCore does NOT import litellm.proxy, does NOT bundle the
    enterprise/ directory, and does NOT redistribute LiteLLM source
    code. LiteLLM is installed from the upstream package index by the
    end user's environment.

